<title>EGYPT: Saudi crown prince in talks with Mubarak.</title>
<headline>Saudi crown prince in talks with Mubarak.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egyptian President Hosni Mubarak met Saudi Arabia's Crown Prince Abdullah bin Abdul-Aziz on Tuesday for talks on bilateral relations and Arab affairs, government sources said.</p>
<p>Prince Abdullah arrived in Cairo earlier on Tuesday at the start of a two-day visit.</p>
</text>
